  "system": {
    "description": "<p>When you suspect a room, door, chest, or other object has an active trap, this is the Skill you want. Make an Unopposed Skill Check. Roll with Disadvantage when using this Skill to scan an entire room or while moving. On Success, you are alerted to the presence of a non-magic trap, which typically allows you to avoid triggering it. On Fail, you sense nothing, and a trap may or may not be present.</p>",
